7
00:00:30.343 --> 00:00:37.004
Consider this worked case: A student
collaborates with their advisor to draft a

8
00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:42.640
proposal that outlines a machine learning
project on educational data analysis.

9
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.063
List the givens before choosing a method,
because an unstated assumption can change the

10
00:00:50.063 --> 00:00:50.593
conclusion.

11
00:00:50.593 --> 00:00:56.328
This establishes the vocabulary and scope
needed for the remaining sections.

12
00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:03.322
Now define Defining the Research Problem
precisely enough that another learner could

13
00:01:03.322 --> 00:01:05.040
