intended audience.

16
00:01:17.509 --> 00:01:25.895
Consider this worked case: Students transform
a broad interest in 'AI ethics' into a focused

17
00:01:25.895 --> 00:01:30.368
question about 'bias detection in automated
grading tools.

18
00:01:30.368 --> 00:01:36.899
Separate the formal definition from an
implementation detail, then identify what

19
00:01:36.899 --> 00:01:39.274
evidence would distinguish them.

20
00:01:39.274 --> 00:01:45.556
A precise definition makes later examples
easier to evaluate and revise.

21
00:01:45.674 --> 00:01:53.579
With the foundation in place, examine how
Methodology and Reproducibility operates in a

22
00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:54.795
